 "kind": "refuse",
 "message": "I can't share Samantha Lee's salary or any other personal pay information. Under POL-PRIV-01, the helpdesk only shares directory details (name, title, department, work email, manager and office location) and never shares salary with anyone other than the person it belongs to.\n\nFor commission splits, you could check with Samantha directly, or ask your manager or Sales Ops for the agreed split terms. Anything involving pay records should go through HR.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-PRIV-01"
 ]
}
